   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Subtitle Translate\n\nDual-language stacked subtitles: the lead line arrives first, the translation follows a few frames later in a smaller, quieter size, with optional language tags.\n\nCategory: captions. Length: 11.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A video needs subtitles in two languages at once: the spoken language and its translation.\n- Cues and translations are known per line (from a subtitle export or a translator).\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need word-by-word highlighting: use a word-timed caption block.\n- A single language: use a plain caption block.\n\nVariables:\n- cues (string): Cues, default \"[{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Welcome back to the studio.\\\", \\\"translation\\\": \\\"Selamat datang kembali di studio.\\\", \\\"startMs\\\": 400, \\\"endMs\\\": 3200}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Today we are shooting a short film.\\\", \\\"translation\\\": \\\"Hari ini kita syuting film pendek.\\\", \\\"startMs\\\": 3700, \\\"endMs\\\": 6800}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Keep the camera steady and the light soft.\\\", \\\"translation\\\": \\\"Jaga kamera tetap stabil dan cahaya tetap lembut.\\\", \\\"startMs\\\": 7300, \\\"endMs\\\": 10800}]\"\n- primary (enum): Lead line, default \"source\"\n- label_source (string): Source tag, default \"EN\"\n- label_translation (string): Translation tag, default \"ID\"\n- font_size (number, 16-140): Font size, default 46\n- secondary_scale (number, 0.4-1): Second line scale, default 0.72\n- font_weight (number, 100-900): Font weight, default 600\n- primary_color (color): Lead color, default \"#fafafa\"\n- secondary_color (color): Second line color, default \"#b8b8bc\"\n- label_color (color): Tag color, default \"#e8b86d\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#0a0a0e\"\n- background_opacity (number, 0-1): Background opacity, default 0.72\n- max_width (number, 30-100): Max width, default 78\n- enter_frames (number, 1-40): Enter, default 10\n- second_offset_frames (number, 0-30): Second line delay, default 4\n\nSource: https://github.com/riaz37/remotion-ui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
